        EN: "The next day, we went to the camera shop. The salesman showed us several cameras. Hugo picked up a model and said to me: \"Look at this one. It's perfect, but it's expensive.\" I answered: \"Show it to me!\" He gave it to me and I checked the price. I asked the salesman: \"Do you give a discount to students?\" \"Yes, I'm giving you ten per cent off.\" So we bought it right away.",
