        EN: "One problem remained: the guest list. Hugo asked me: \"Did you invite the cousins?\" \"Yes, I sent them a message yesterday, and they already confirmed it to me.\" \"And Léa's friends?\" \"I haven't contacted them yet. Give me their numbers, please.\" \"I'll send them to you tonight. But there are a lot of them, you know: about twenty!\" I answered: \"There's enough room in the garden, there will be enough for everyone.\"",
